# Design system

## Tokens (define once in `src/ui/tokens.css` as CSS custom properties; never hard-code colors elsewhere)
```css
:root {
  color-scheme: dark;
  --bg: #0e0f13;          --surface: #161820;    --surface-2: #1d2029;
  --border: #2a2e3a;      --text: #e7e9ee;       --muted: #9aa0ad;
  --green: #3ddc97;       --green-soft: rgb(61 220 151 / 0.12);   /* primary, success, progress */
  --purple: #a78bfa;      --purple-soft: rgb(167 139 250 / 0.12); /* agent, hints, AI content */
  --warn: #f5b971;        /* "not quite" — calm amber, never alarm red */
  --on-accent: #0e0f13;   /* text on green/purple fills */
  --radius: 12px; --radius-lg: 16px;
  --space-1: 4px; --space-2: 8px; --space-3: 12px; --space-4: 16px;
  --space-5: 24px; --space-6: 32px; --space-7: 48px; --space-8: 64px;
  --font: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  --mono: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
}
```
- **Green** = primary action ("Check", "Next") and success. **Purple** = anything from the agent (hints, explanations, generated problems). Never mix the two meanings.
- At most one filled accent button per screen. Everything else is ghost or outline.

## Typography
- Base 17px, line-height 1.6, max text width `68ch`. Scale: 14 / 17 / 20 / 26 / 32px.
- Weights 400 and 600 only. Sentence case, no ALL CAPS paragraphs. KaTeX at `1.05em`, display math scrolls horizontally on small screens.
- Fonts are system or self-hosted. No external font requests (offline + privacy).

## Layout: one task in focus
- A single centered column, `max-width: 720px`, generous padding (`--space-5` on mobile, `--space-7` on desktop).
- Order: minimal top bar (title, settings icon) → **task card** → answer area → hint panel (purple, collapsible) → one primary button. No sidebars on the solving screen.
- Progress and memory stats live on a separate, quiet screen. They never compete with the task.

## Motion
- Only `opacity`/`transform`, 150–200ms, `ease-out`. No looping, blinking, shaking, parallax, or confetti.
- `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` → disable transitions and animations.

## Accessibility
- WCAG **AA** contrast at minimum (body text ≥ 4.5:1, large text/UI ≥ 3:1). Check `--muted` on `--surface-2`.
- Visible focus ring everywhere: `outline: 2px solid var(--green); outline-offset: 2px` (purple inside agent panels). Never `outline: none` without a replacement.
- Fully keyboard operable: Enter = check, `H` = next hint, `N` = next problem (shown in a small help line). Semantic HTML, labelled inputs, `aria-live="polite"` for feedback.
- Touch targets ≥ 44×44px.

## Responsive
- Mobile first. Breakpoints: `600px` (tablet/iPad) and `1024px` (desktop). Test at 375px, 768px/1024px (iPad, both orientations) and 1440px.
- Respect `env(safe-area-inset-*)` for the installed iOS PWA. Inputs ≥ 16px font so iOS doesn't zoom.
